Sval: Remove tab notes and content sharing

Tab notes and content sharing were pref-off experiments; content
sharing published a page of links through a Mozilla server and needed a
Mozilla account. Both go whole, with their menu items, hover preview
panel, the canonical URL actor and session field that only tab notes
read, prefs, Nimbus features, strings, icons and tests.

